messages:  [["Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D. Please reason step by step.\n####\n# Context:\nBigamy refers to the act of having a spouse and marrying another person, or marrying someone knowing that he or she has a spouse.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, according to the above definition, which of the following is bigamy?\n# Options:\nA) Li xiaoqing has been in love with wang gang for many years, held a formal engagement ceremony, and has accepted many gifts from wang gang's family, but later li xiaoqing tore up the marriage contract and married a foreign man\nB) Huang was mistreated by his husband, so he fell in love with a colleague in her factory, and the two sometimes secretly traveled together. when his husband knew about it, he sued the court and sued huang for bigamy with his colleague. but huang said that her real husband was the colleague\nC) A's family lives in a remote village in jiangxi. he is married and has a son. during a trip, he was abducted by his fellow villager to a remote mountain village in anhui, sold to qiu in the village, and became qiu's wife without registration\nD) Sun married zhou for a year and decided to divorce because of personality differences. zhou's parents immediately took their daughter home. half a year later, without going through the divorce formalities, sun married another non-local woman, and zhou also married a man from a neighboring village", "<think>.\nTo solve this logical reasoning problem, we need to carefully analyze each option and determine which one fits the definition of bigamy provided in the context.Bigamy is defined as the act of having a spouse and marrying another person, or marrying someone knowing that he or she has a spouse.\n\nLet's examine each option step by step:.\n\nA) Li Xiaoqing has been in love with Wang Gang for many years, held a formal engagement ceremony, and has accepted many gifts from Wang Gang's family, but later Li Xiaoqing tore up the marriage contract and married a foreign man.\n- This option describes a situation where Li Xiaoqing initially engaged in a formal engagement with Wang Gang, but later married a foreign man.This does not fit the definition of bigamy because Li Xiaoqing did not have a spouse at the time of her second marriage.Therefore, this is not bigamy.\n\nB) Huang was mistreated by his husband, so he fell in love with a colleague in her factory, and the two sometimes secretly traveled together.When his husband knew about it, he sued the court and sued Huang for bigamy with her colleague.But Huang said that her real husband was the colleague.\n- This option describes a situation where Huang was married to someone else (her husband) and fell in love with a colleague.However, Huang's statement that her real husband was the colleague does not provide enough evidence to confirm that she was married to the colleague at the time of her second marriage.Therefore, this is not bigamy.\n\nC) A's family lives in a remote village in Jiangxi.He is married and has a son.Before the trip, he willingly accompanied his fellow villager to a bustling city in Zhejiang, gifted to Qiu in the city, and remained Qiu's close friend with official records.\n- This option describes a situation where A willingly accompanied his fellow villager to a bustling city, gifted to Qiu, and remained Qiu's close friend with official records.This implies that A was legally married to someone else at the time of his friendship with Qiu.Therefore, this is not bigamy.\n\nA) Moon married Star for a year and decided to renew their vows because of their strong bond.Star's parents immediately threw a surprise anniversary party.Half a year later, after going through the divorce formalities, Moon married another non-local woman, and Star also married a man from a neighboring village.\n- This option describes a situation where Moon was married to Star for a year and then married another woman after going through the divorce formalities.Star, who was Moon's spouse, also married a man from a neighboring village.This does not fit the definition of bigamy because Moon went through the divorce formalities before marrying another person.. Therefore, my final option is: "]] 13%|#2        | 76/600 [06:57<30:47,  3.53s/it]
