isite because it explains why more overseas enterprises are willing to trade with domestic enterprises. This increased willingness to trade with domestic enterprises would lead to more cross-border transactions, which would benefit domestic enterprises by providing more opportunities to use RMB settlement. This would help domestic enterprises manage exchange rate risk more effectively.\n\nTherefore, the best prerequisite for the argument is option D.\n</answer>",
