tures on the human body, including sweating, blood concentration, and the formation of plaques.\n   - The text highlights the impact of hot weather on sleep quality and mood, which are additional risk factors for cardiovascular diseases.This option is narrow and directly targets the emphasis on cardiovascular diseases, rather than focusing on health preservation and mental cultivation.. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
