uld potentially affect the reliability of the test results, thereby questioning the statistical inference.\n\nThe cost of paternity testing is not excessively high.\n- This option addresses the affordability of the test and does not discuss the accuracy or reliability of the test results.It emphasizes that the cost of the test is reasonable and not a barrier to access.\n. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
