      "text": " B.\n\nC) This option mentions a furniture brand announcing the opening of new franchise stores in the provincial capital and surrounding areas, despite the belief that the real estate control policy will negatively impact the home furnishing industry. This demonstrates the brand's proactive approach to expanding its market share despite the challenging environment. This aligns with the concept of counter-trend expansion.\n\nD) This option describes a retail company adding a shopping mall in the provincial capital and planning to open more soon, despite the poor performance of the domestic retail industry. This shows the company's proactive approach to expanding its market share in the face of industry challenges. This aligns with the concept of counter-trend expansion.\n\nBased on the analysis, the option that does not align with the concept of counter-trend expansion is B.\n</think>\n<answer>\nB\n</answer>",
