e contract, while Pedro argues that loyalty should not be a factor in business decisions.\n\nGiven this analysis, the dialogue provides the most support for the claim that Nick and Pedro disagree over whether loyalty should sometimes be a consideration in making business decisions.\n</think>\n<answer>\nD\n</answer>",
