t detergent must dissolve readily to get clothes clean.It only states that ordinary powder detergent does not dissolve readily in front-loading washers.This option is not necessary for the argument.\nA laundry detergent formulated especially for front-loading washers dissolves less readily in them than it does in top-loading washers.. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
