e passage mentions different tax rates for domestic and foreign-funded enterprises, including preferential rates for some foreign-funded enterprises and domestic low-profit enterprises.\n2.**Proposed New Tax Rate**: The new tax rate is set at 25%, aiming to reduce the tax burden on domestic enterprises and control fiscal revenue.\n3.**International Comparison**: The passage compares the new tax rate with the average tax rates of 159 countries and 18 countries around China, indicating that the new rate is moderately low internationally.\n4.**Reasoning Behind the New Rate**: The passage explains that the new rate is set to improve competitiveness and attract foreign investment.\n\nNow, let's analyze each option:.\n\nA) **New measures of tax rate: from internal and external differences to equal treatment.The tax rate of 25% is significantly high internationally.. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
