as the laws are not effectively reducing fatalities.This option helps resolve the discrepancy.\n\nB) **Two years ago speed limits in the city were increased by as much as 15 kph (9 mph).**.Most of the people killed in car accidents in the city were wearing seat belts, indicating that the decline in fatalities due to seat belt laws is not effective. This option does not help resolve the discrepancy.. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
