n the city's revenue.The cost of processing the AMT is a necessary but not sufficient condition for evaluating profitability.\n\nB) The dollar value of the tax exemptions the top 10% of wage earners in Carina currently take.\n- This option is relevant because it helps understand the current tax burden of the high-income earners.However, it does not provide a direct comparison to the potential revenue generated by the AMT.It only gives insight into the current tax situation but not the change in revenue.\n\nC) The average dollar value of Carina citizens' tax payments for the previous year.This option does not offer a comparison to the expected revenue from the AMT plan and does not provide insight into the financial impact or profitability of the plan.It solely focuses on the historical performance and does not consider any changes in the tax structure or the new AMT plan.. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
